# Force LF on checkout for everything textual.
#
# Why: judges clone on Windows where Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true.
# Without this file, every text file (iris.script, create-fast-namespace.script,
# *.sh, *.cls, seed JSON) checks out with CRLF, gets COPY'd into the Linux Docker
# image by `docker compose up --build`, and the build breaks. LF is safe on all
# platforms; modern Windows editors handle it fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.mp4 binary
